{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6cce53a5ff06a120fa2cbc8a6b179b5f6c5b4d4c4b68783668f82aa4b4aa04ff", "ja": "結成！　エターナルハーモニー", "zh": "集结！『Eternal Harmony』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "420b5eecd7a93ad2b5ae97d8dee0dffbff89b8fbcd54c95e3e4935d4f48032d8", "ja": "新しいユニットを組むことになった千早、\nジュリア、風花、エミリー、まつりの5人。\n千早は、それぞれの個性を活かし、歌の魂を\n表現したいと語る。ジュリアの提案で、勉強\nを兼ね、ロックフェスを観に行くことに。", "zh": "千早、茱莉亚、风花、艾蜜莉、茉莉，\n这五人即将组成新团体。\n千早表示想发挥各自的特色，呈现出歌曲的灵魂。\n在茱莉亚的提议下，众人决定前往欣赏摇滚祭兼观摩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "06a5240db482b0fb4308d7ebc924c2920ffbd93dae9c7c825a821ec8409b26f5", "ja": "（今日はエターナルハーモニーの初回ミーティング。\nみんなもう来ているはずだ、気合いを入れていこう！）", "zh": "（今天是『Eternal Harmony』第一次开会。\n大家应该都已经来了，我要提起干劲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0fd8e46f3897528223e64adc50cfe1b578532778485e33a721c1458655f61241", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私たちに\n何かお話があるって聞きましたけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n听说有事要对我们宣布……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1f0141ed38d9828e0972e0a186ccd7d2d5b81534e07c71703762bed9f0111ff2", "ja": "そうなんだ。\n今日、皆に集まってもらったのは他でもない。", "zh": "是这样没错。\n今天请大家在这里集合不为别的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "951f9d1292affeb14dc4fc5e56a6ee2964ed7a3f362a776dbb4a347e5b92d5ca", "ja": "この5人で、ユニットを組んでもらうことになった。\nその名も『エターナルハーモニー』だ！", "zh": "我要请你们五个人组成团体，\n团名叫做『Eternal Harmony』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "59e49e9842514829c0a00ab357cd590d84d41f9e285816d3815cde83ee21648a", "ja": "『永遠の交響曲』……！\nWow！　とても素敵な集団名ですね♪", "zh": "『永恒交响曲』……！\nWow！这个集团名称真棒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "55f8f6971c298f11e27d09ac5967e8e99dff4aebcdcb501c3ab1474a1ba57a8c", "ja": "なんか、お嬢さまっぽい感じの名前だけど……\nあたしがいて大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "名字听起来就很千金大小姐风格……\n确定要选我当团员吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "a7ca320b57fb515e5de8fbc38a6900a894f7d006c86fe392a24978983ca124fe", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nユニットのリーダーは、もう決まっているのです？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n已经决定好团体队长是谁了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5eb712b8cb84bf86541154c4e4b3b93036a5ef184ebb6f286dfb05c60b765abb", "ja": "ああ。エターナルハーモニーのリーダーは、\n千早に任せようと思っている。", "zh": "嗯，『Eternal Harmony』的队长，\n我想请千早来担任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "d196b9ef646f15076f46e0b9eeeb6271726a2c50cbb14ebb579eda9c7085da76", "ja": "えっ。私が、リーダーですか？", "zh": "咦，我来担任队长吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "136425935110512a187bd4948321e9fb651234f9b6a536f3c7e1d75b23b50b2f", "ja": "もしイヤなら無理にとは言わないけど、\n俺は千早が適任だと思うよ。どうだ、千早？", "zh": "如果你不愿意的话我不勉强，\n但我觉得千早你很适任。你愿意吗，千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "03c11c699f2000e64fa402299ba2b587cd07c05958daf98be984fae6a808dc22", "ja": "春香や美希ならともかく……\n私がリーダーに向いているとは思えません。", "zh": "要是春香或美希还说得过去……\n我不认为我适合当队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "6a219526da9e5a7147bacd48efd6edc38f8b8803d608bac1bdb1bb01477afae6", "ja": "ですが……。これまでの、劇場のみんなの\nユニットは、どれも素晴らしいと思いました。", "zh": "不过……我觉得至今为止，\n剧场伙伴们组成的团体，每个都很出色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "35f8cafe933225477239686234b8624fbf3cf7f613261026c6471f490697437f", "ja": "ですから……私も、挑戦してみたいです。\nリーダーの大役、お引き受けいたします。", "zh": "所以……我也想挑战看看。\n我愿意接下队长这份重责大任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f1e1db829bef7eaa46c84340f29711fc1d3924e995380518f346fcdfd2ce8727", "ja": "よし、決まりだな。\n期待してるぞ、千早！", "zh": "好，那就这么决定了。\n期待你的表现啰，千早！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "1fd708ec0dbe3e25e1e54175ec3fdc1927f4188f3dfc7cca4967ef2ead235be7", "ja": "はい。それでは……みんな、改めて……。\nどうぞ、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "是。那么……在场的各位……\n再次请大家多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b7c4355c1df8066de62fa34092925f56f36f9c7641c0d16d08a4cbf0a055e126", "ja": "こちらこそ！　千早ちゃんは真面目でしっかり者だし、\nリーダーにぴったりだと思うな♪", "zh": "我才要请你多多指教！\n千早这么认真能干，我觉得很适合当队长♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "737a79d7522903539dfaf6a55874ccaeed7ee1eecf08e36bb1f987ec00019d10", "ja": "私も、束ね役の千早さんについてまいります。\nよろしくお願いしますね♪", "zh": "我也会追随统筹者千早。\n请多多指教喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "9bf9b9a46a70d55c78d580d413bc2f6c8138475019764716f56a8006ff097b43", "ja": "まつり、リーダーをやってみたかったのです～。\nでも今回は、千早ちゃんに譲るのですよ。", "zh": "茉莉也想当当看队长的说～\n但这次就让给小千早了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "361856cb0089d6b8c503b4d2de8cd2542e9def3f7633f959a7722009814a9f69", "ja": "もしリーダーをやめたくなったら、姫が代わって\nあげますから、気楽に頑張るのです！　……ね？", "zh": "你如果不想当队长了，公主会代替你的，\n所以你就放轻松去努力的喔！……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "e1142e750c3a51bd3bc1c225b88150ad70e0cd34ca0da6414974878e970c2b4f", "ja": "ありがとう……みんな。", "zh": "大家……谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "459ab98225839af7a9c2e8fadb65f06e099ba1ede16a6edc86272723102f67ed", "ja": "チハ。\nウチらのリーダーとして、最初にひとつ聞かせてくれ。", "zh": "千。\n现在你是我们的队长，我有个问题想先问你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "33814ce40bfad4a612a325b99a730a3896879c5efd7ba0e9dff49da1ad515a43", "ja": "チハはこのエターナルハーモニーを、\nどんなユニットにしたいんだ？", "zh": "千打算把我们『Eternal Harmony』，\n塑造成怎么样的团体呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "40b6165ed07483160986082a9c00c5f1eb188d6358a0f4d88cb1a50cc576d9b9", "ja": "姫はフリフリな衣装を着て、\nとびきり・きゅーと！なダンスを踊りたいのです。", "zh": "公主想穿着飘逸的荷叶边服装跳舞，\n要跳超级可爱的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "77fe964783cf0588668d4a1fb775fde2095c77ff6753eea1d70218aa7fc25448", "ja": "うっ！\n……あ、あたしは、それは遠慮したいな……。", "zh": "唔！\n……那、那种风格就饶了我吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "16f758a265bb3a6202bebbafc051af4300bcebcedf99c94489d8e66471cd1895", "ja": "どんなユニット……そうね。\n私は……この5人で、歌の高みを目指したい。", "zh": "怎么样的团体啊……我想想。\n我想要……五个人一起，朝歌唱的顶点前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "a19e4f72617ee8836b94b0370d33f191521c6caec43231761d67e86ad67c156e", "ja": "……？　歌の高み……ですか？", "zh": "……歌唱的顶点……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "d51ee348d15775a20f5ed4941b2ac8780475863468b9166d616c8d58b833c9c5", "ja": "ええ。\n私たちは、それぞれが違った個性を持っているわ。", "zh": "是的。\n我们各自拥有自己的个人特色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "0f7773f23953a958e3b063dfa96d23e98f0dc6591ba2e57837d569c5d6bfeea3", "ja": "その違いを活かせば、きっとこの5人にしかできない\nハーモニーが生まれるはず……。", "zh": "如果能发挥这些不同之处，\n一定能创造只有我们五人才能唱出的和音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "020cdba269190e6ea542952e6b8e416be6468d1e39d4ab2a51907cd9688a3a17", "ja": "私達5人ならではの……そう、歌にこめた\n魂のようなものを、表現できればと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "我希望能呈现出我们五人独有的特色……\n对了，就像是倾注于歌曲中的灵魂那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "470340760a0c4eb86b3a2a03a8fe4828f4489c25600564d17510b8d7c7070905", "ja": "歌の魂……それだ！", "zh": "歌曲的灵魂……就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c8b4b8535669ca8fdc2831c3db7cacd22163d9ccc7a8d91c590c765732ccc2ed", "ja": "きゃっ！？\n急に大声を出して、どうしたの？　ジュリアちゃん。", "zh": "哇！？\n你怎么突然大叫啊，茱莉亚？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "792be74f02d72c2b076f4b0cbcea1fd82b33cb2175f0ed68f6c88f1ebb112c80", "ja": "あ、あはは……フーカ、悪い。\nチハの言葉にグッときちまって、つい……。", "zh": "啊、啊哈哈……风花，抱歉。\n因为千说的话太让我感动了，忍不住就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "5d194cb815e139930c79c8b8e38b6c1484e8751b2c77536cceb640f4d51740be", "ja": "いや、でもいいと思う！\nこの5人ならではの『歌の魂』、目指そうぜ！", "zh": "哎呀，但我觉得这样很好！\n就以我们五人独有的『歌曲的灵魂』为目标吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "233024de085806f12ff596ed4b7c6da548ed0e742c6d14e7ba3d67176fc41406", "ja": "ありがとうジュリア。ただ、それを表現するために\nどんなレッスンをすればいいか、まだ思いつかなくて。", "zh": "谢谢你，茱莉亚。只不过我还没想到，\n如果我们想呈现这点，该做怎么样的训练才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "75ed7b952fb94724af26f480e633e0315650b41fed36aaa1d9b6edf5cbce4040", "ja": "{$P$}。\n何か、いい考えはないでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n你有什么好点子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "5f3453f5394ac48df9e68d02f750469c082a8cb7e8f5e79d961e2a5b401be099", "ja": "そうだな……。劇場の仲間達以外の\nライブを見てみるのも、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我想想……不如走出剧场，\n看看其他人开的演唱会，可能也不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "12fe3d53013401339bd51430778fe3387f3e3ab1bed3b69fe49e4184a7dbb093", "ja": "劇場以外の……？\n他の事務所のアイドル、ということですか？", "zh": "走出剧场……？\n你是指去看其他事务所的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "d2cd3f149f7edecad109547f540e523734be40d12b38a40efcb744fff4a78d3a", "ja": "アイドルでも、違うジャンルでも。色んなものを\n見る事で、自分達の良さが見えてくるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "偶像或其他领域的都行，如果多方面到处看看，\n应该就会开始发觉自己的团体优点何在吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "e11a0d936ec46a1127da0e89902c25197f62cffafeb775b3d5d078a36920c6e8", "ja": "アイドル以外のライブってことなら……\nちょうど今週末に、ロックフェスがあるんだ。", "zh": "如果要看偶像以外的演唱会……\n刚好这周末有摇滚祭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "25b3af249701835e37f346ed7814439cc4e551e13ecebb25c9956b326c784f88", "ja": "あたしは個人的に行こうと思ってたんだけど、\nせっかくだから、みんなで行かないか？", "zh": "我本来打算自己私下去的，\n但难得有这个机会，要不要大家一起去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1041_032emi", "source_sha256": "984222e83cccd339e275ccfdd1353fde0316ea0bde304c782fe5f69c92bf6b5d", "ja": "反骨精神音楽祭……！　なんだか、面白そうです！", "zh": "反骨精神音乐祭……！听起来很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a2e5ccaa789be6899283c2542153fad7e757c88ebbbc98388c2768229cd7baf7", "ja": "ロックの和訳って、反骨精神でいいのかな？", "zh": "把「摇滚」讲成「反骨精神」是对的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "75bbeb2d3502c79d434cf1df202c3fc551f30173ceb5e45a87d14c5c6131b00a", "ja": "いや、多分違うと思う……。\nけどまあ、面白いからいいか。ははっ！", "zh": "不，我想大概不对……\n不过算了，反正很有趣，哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_01_1044_002chi", "source_sha256": "f8a28ca39fe262408ac53322edf423a17d767b9d9c371a863d1d0cd55734b8da", "ja": "それじゃ、決定ね。\nみんな、今日から公演まで、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "那就这么决定了。\n各位，从今天起到公演的期间，请你们多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
